sion":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041218","verified_at":"2026-10-25T06:19:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5082780-1847286114041152","game_id":"steam-5082780","kind":"announcement","title":"Dreampair desktop DEMO is live at Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hi everyone! Thank you so much for playing the demo. I've been reading your reviews and community feedback, and I'm so happy you're enjoying it! Next Fest ends on Oct 26, 10:00 AM PDT, so there's about a day left. The demo will stay available after the event ends. please add Dreampair to your wishlist and tell your friends. It means a lot to a solo-developed game. Dreampair does not use generative AI, and it won't in the future either. Your support helps this small indie project keep going. Than","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:41:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041152","verified_at":"2026-10-25T06:19:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5082780-1846651706683924","game_id":"steam-5082780","kind":"update","title":"Dreampair Desktop DEMO HOTFIX & Update (Oct 17)","summary":"Hotfix Update News (Oct 17) System we've partially improved the issue of characters hiding behind other windows. Thank you for waiting! In General Settings, you can now turn on \"Launch automatically after Steam login at startup\" Focus Mode now has focus and break sounds Floor offset can now go up more The mouth stays still during thought bubbles Customization Improved the edges of bodies, faces and ears where other colors were mixing in Added an option to place the tail layer above the back hair","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T06:41:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683924","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5082780-1846651706672609","game_id":"steam-5082780","kind":"update","title":"Dreampair Desktop DEMO Update & Bug fix (Oct 14)","summary":"Dreampair Demo Small Update Hi everyone! Thank you so much for playing and for all the bug reports. This update adds a few new options and fixes a bunch of part issues. General You can now turn off the cat in General Settings The head direction stays fixed when the walking direction changes Speech bubble tails stay attached even when bubbles stack upward You can change pair relationship, catchphrase and nickname in the Bubble Talk default dialogue settings Customization Eyes and mouths can now b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T22:39:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672609","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5082780-1846018067936422","game_id":"steam-5082780","kind":"announcement","title":"Dreampair desktop Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"The Dreampair demo is out now! We've added a wide variety of face parts for this demo. We're planning to offer many more body options in the full version. There are 6 hidden items to find in the demo. We won't say how to unlock them, but we think you'll find them easily! If you enjoy the game, please tell your friends! Adding it to your wishlist is a huge help for development! We'd love to see the pairs you make. Share them with #dreampairdesktop! Pairs you make in the demo carry over to the ful","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T14:38:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936422",